Chapter 8

Data Sovereignty and Privacy

8.1 Data Classification

Data Class Description Security AI Access Rehabilitation AI Access Human Access
A — Perimeter Intrusion, boundary sensors Yes No Security staff
B — Administrative Scheduling, logistics Limited Limited Authorized staff
C — Rehabilitation Education, skills, PSAC No Yes Resident, educators
D — Clinical Medical, mental health No No Clinicians only
