R = L \times I

Extended:

R = L \times I \times C

Where:

· L = likelihood of event (0 to 1 or qualitative scale)
· I = impact severity (1 to 5)
· C = control failure factor (1 = fully effective controls; higher = weaker controls)

G.2 Qualitative Scales

Level Likelihood Impact
1 Very unlikely Negligible
