G.4 Worked Example: AI False Positive on Security Alert

· L = 3 (possible)
· I = 2 (minor, human review catches)
· C = 1.0 (human override fully effective)

R = 3 \times 2 \times 1.0 = 6

G.5 Risk Acceptance

Risks with R > 12 require mitigation before operational deployment. Risks with 8 < R \le 12 require continuous monitoring. Risks with R \le 8 are accepted with routine controls.

